OL,3,GNEWSAGang jailed over #2m city drugs
OL,4,Anetwork
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lincoln-based drugs gang that flooded
OL,7,Fthe city with #2m worth of cocaine,
OL,8,Fketamine and cannabis has been
OL,9,Fdismantled, with four members jailed
OL,10,Ffollowing a major police investigation.
OL,12,FLincolnshire Police said the drugs were
OL,13,Fsupplied on to the streets of the city
OL,14,Fbetween January 2024 and July 2025.
OL,16,FLincoln Crown Court heard the gang was
OL,17,Fled by Gabby Nganyi, 22, and was
OL,18,Funcovered after a suspected drug deal
OL,19,Fin the Glebe Park area of the city.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
